WEBVTT

02:01.930 --> 02:05.640
<b>Episode 9
"Moon"</b>

02:05.640 --> 02:10.770
<b>To: Yukinari
Subject: Hinode-hama today 
Good weather all day.
In front of the gelato store.</b>

02:13.120 --> 02:17.110
<b>What am I writing this for?</b>

02:29.370 --> 02:32.010
<b>Why? Just why?</b>

02:36.630 --> 02:38.880
<b>Message from Sacchan</b>

02:46.740 --> 02:48.320
<b>For tomorrow?</b>

02:49.940 --> 02:53.940
<b>From: Sacchan
Subject: For tomorrow
"Ten Nights of Dreams."</b>

02:51.140 --> 02:52.800
<b>"Ten Nights of Dreams."</b>

02:53.100 --> 02:53.940
<b>What's that?</b>

02:54.210 --> 02:55.940
<b>May I help you?</b>

02:56.680 --> 02:57.780
<b>Not really.</b>

03:05.580 --> 03:06.900
<b>Nee-chan...</b>

03:06.900 --> 03:08.200
<b>Fine, fine.</b>

03:09.440 --> 03:12.170
<b>It's the name of a novel, isn't it? 
By Soseki Natsume.</b>

03:12.500 --> 03:13.960
<b>Oh, really?</b>

03:13.960 --> 03:16.120
<b>It's on the shelf at the store.</b>

03:16.960 --> 03:19.780
<b>Oh, yeah?</b>

03:19.780 --> 03:22.090
<b>It's an exam question.</b>

03:22.390 --> 03:24.050
<b>I see.</b>

03:36.690 --> 03:38.570
<b>Issen Ichibyou Monogatari</b>

03:37.320 --> 03:38.570
<b>Did you tell your boyfriend</b>

03:38.880 --> 03:41.700
<b>that you're coming home?</b>

03:42.000 --> 03:42.780
<b>I did.</b>

04:00.010 --> 04:02.630
<b>Soseki Natsume
Ten Nights of Dreams</b>

04:25.360 --> 04:27.370
<b></b>

04:37.670 --> 04:39.710
<b>Inbox
Yanagi
Hinode-hama today</b>

05:31.820 --> 05:33.660
<i>What did Touko see</i>

05:34.680 --> 05:35.820
<i>about me?</i>

06:18.620 --> 06:21.150
<i>I can't hear the fragment.</i>

06:26.540 --> 06:27.430
<b>Navel?</b>

06:27.730 --> 06:28.580
<b>Why?</b>

06:41.590 --> 06:42.770
<b>Hina-chan?</b>

06:43.630 --> 06:45.780
<b>Sorry to interrupt your running.</b>

06:46.880 --> 06:48.280
<b>Oh, right.</b>

06:48.280 --> 06:49.180
<b>I—</b>

06:53.280 --> 06:56.390
<b>Right, we promised to go shopping together.</b>

06:56.830 --> 06:58.980
<b>Come over tomorrow if you have time.</b>

06:58.980 --> 07:00.480
<b>Thanks.</b>

07:00.480 --> 07:03.140
<b>Don't tell Onee-chan yet.</b>

07:03.140 --> 07:04.430
<b>Trust me. I get it.</b>

07:04.430 --> 07:05.360
<b>See you tomorrow.</b>

07:09.220 --> 07:12.410
<i>Has something happened recently, Onee-chan?</i>

07:17.550 --> 07:20.300
<b>Say, Kakeru, what are you
going to do after you graduate?</b>

07:22.260 --> 07:23.250
<b>I wonder.</b>

07:24.910 --> 07:26.460
<b>You sure haven't changed.</b>

07:26.920 --> 07:30.330
<b>I think you should start
thinking about your future.</b>

07:30.660 --> 07:31.300
<b>That's true.</b>

07:31.960 --> 07:34.380
<b>You should find a stable job.</b>

07:34.380 --> 07:36.660
<b>Not that I'm in a position to talk.</b>

07:38.140 --> 07:40.140
<b>Your father and I both knew what we wanted</b>

07:40.140 --> 07:42.290
<b>to be ever since we were little kids.</b>

07:42.290 --> 07:44.460
<b>That wasn't the case for you though, was it?</b>

07:44.460 --> 07:46.660
<b>Because Mom wouldn't stay put, huh?</b>

07:46.660 --> 07:48.120
<b>You're going overseas next, aren't you?</b>

07:48.420 --> 07:50.820
<b>It looks like I'll be gone for a while this time.</b>

07:50.820 --> 07:51.830
<b>I see.</b>

07:52.480 --> 07:53.490
<b>I'm going back, now.</b>

07:58.810 --> 08:01.250
<b>That boy said he liked it here,</b>

08:01.250 --> 08:03.630
<b>so I thought he found something he wanted to do.</b>

08:04.350 --> 08:05.710
<b>His girlfriend, I'm sure.</b>

08:06.020 --> 08:08.400
<b>I want to see her just once.</b>

08:08.400 --> 08:10.790
<b>If you come back again
during the summer break.</b>

08:11.090 --> 08:13.110
<b>Just don't get in their way, please.</b>

08:14.100 --> 08:17.250
<b>My happiness is partly thanks to him.</b>

08:17.600 --> 08:21.350
<b>If he asked me, I'd support
him with everything I have.</b>

08:21.950 --> 08:24.270
<b>You're really just lonely, aren't you?</b>

08:25.140 --> 08:26.640
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

08:26.640 --> 08:28.220
<b>Of course I am.</b>

08:31.070 --> 08:32.740
<b>To: Yukinari
Subject: Hinode-hama today
Good weather today.
Hinode Bridge, futon...</b>

08:38.990 --> 08:41.000
<b>New message</b>

08:50.700 --> 08:51.710
<i>Yes?</i>

08:51.710 --> 08:54.210
<b>Hi, it's Hina.</b>

08:55.800 --> 08:57.280
<b>Come in.</b>

08:58.700 --> 09:00.080
<b>Thanks!</b>

09:00.510 --> 09:01.350
<b>Oh, this.</b>

09:01.710 --> 09:03.940
<b>Yeah, Touko gave me that.</b>

09:03.940 --> 09:06.210
<b>So, I was thinking,</b>

09:06.210 --> 09:09.050
<b>I have a lot of clothes
 that I can't wear anymore.</b>

09:09.350 --> 09:11.440
<b>Do you want to try them 
on before we go shopping?</b>

09:12.370 --> 09:14.130
<b>Yes, please!</b>

09:18.210 --> 09:20.490
<b>It's perfect. So cute.</b>

09:21.910 --> 09:25.210
<b>Maybe not that skirt. Something more frilly.</b>

09:26.300 --> 09:27.930
<b>Hey, Yanagi-san...</b>

09:28.660 --> 09:30.240
<b>Did you find something you want to wear?</b>

09:31.130 --> 09:33.230
<b>About Onee-chan...</b>

09:34.110 --> 09:36.300
<b>That's what you've been wanting
to ask since yesterday, right?</b>

09:37.490 --> 09:38.630
<b>I think she's in love.</b>

09:39.130 --> 09:40.510
<b>You think so too, right?</b>

09:40.830 --> 09:42.310
<b>But it's not a broken heart, is it?</b>

09:42.670 --> 09:44.090
<b>I don't think so.</b>

09:44.420 --> 09:46.520
<b>But I don't think I know</b>

09:46.520 --> 09:48.830
<b>any more than you do.</b>

09:49.150 --> 09:50.340
<b>Oh.</b>

09:50.870 --> 09:52.330
<b>Oh, but I</b>

09:52.330 --> 09:55.650
<b>have a one-sided promise 
to ask someone who probably</b>

09:55.950 --> 09:56.820
<b>knows a lot about it.</b>

09:57.340 --> 10:00.800
<b>"One-sided"? That's not exactly
 a "promise," then, is it?</b>

10:01.510 --> 10:02.540
<b>Maybe not.</b>

10:02.890 --> 10:03.890
<b>Don't worry,</b>

10:04.230 --> 10:06.630
<b>Touko's really important to me.</b>

10:08.890 --> 10:10.880
<b>This is so cute.</b>

10:11.150 --> 10:13.230
<b>Right? Do you like it?</b>

10:13.230 --> 10:14.050
<b>Yes.</b>

10:14.910 --> 10:15.880
<b>You can have it, then.</b>

10:16.350 --> 10:17.780
<b>Sorry it's a hand-me-down.</b>

10:17.780 --> 10:19.840
<b>I'm so happy. Are you sure, though?</b>

10:20.270 --> 10:21.850
<b>I can't wear it anymore, anyway.</b>

10:23.870 --> 10:27.380
<b>That's an outfit Yuki complimented me for.</b>

10:28.450 --> 10:30.440
<b>He probably doesn't 
remember anymore, though.</b>

10:30.690 --> 10:32.310
<b>I can't take it.</b>

10:32.830 --> 10:35.260
<b>I'm going to become a new me.</b>

10:35.260 --> 10:36.980
<b>Even though you're already cute?</b>

10:37.620 --> 10:39.030
<b>Even more.</b>

10:39.510 --> 10:40.400
<b>I—</b>

10:41.170 --> 10:43.880
<b>I'm pulling for you.</b>

10:45.100 --> 10:46.040
<b>Thanks.</b>

10:46.910 --> 10:48.080
<b>Tada!</b>

10:48.420 --> 10:50.110
<b>That's cute.</b>

10:50.110 --> 10:52.130
<b>Yanagi-san gave it to me.</b>

10:52.130 --> 10:54.180
<b>But I think it might be...</b>

10:54.180 --> 10:56.570
<b>Yanagi-san's got such good taste!</b>

10:55.030 --> 10:57.770
<b>...a bit too tight around the waist for me.</b>

11:05.050 --> 11:06.740
<b>How've you been doing lately, Touko?</b>

11:06.740 --> 11:08.770
<b>I'm doing speed sketches and life drawings.</b>

11:09.290 --> 11:11.910
<b>You're lucky you have no written exams.</b>

11:11.910 --> 11:13.020
<b>I kind of do.</b>

11:13.460 --> 11:15.250
<b>Sorry, phone.</b>

11:18.690 --> 11:20.140
<b>Hello, Sacchan?</b>

11:21.260 --> 11:22.800
<b>Sure, I'm fine.</b>

11:23.110 --> 11:25.710
<b>We ended up talking a lot</b>

11:25.710 --> 11:27.190
<b>about Onee-chan today.</b>

11:27.190 --> 11:29.240
<b>Yana-chan was being nice to you,</b>

11:29.240 --> 11:31.080
<b>because you're so worried about your sister.</b>

11:31.380 --> 11:32.650
<b>Oh, yeah.</b>

11:33.490 --> 11:35.630
<b>Sacchan, how were the tests?</b>

11:36.110 --> 11:38.420
<i>I don't get the results for at least a week,</i>

11:38.420 --> 11:39.990
<i>but I'm fine.</i>

11:40.290 --> 11:41.330
<b>Yeah?</b>

11:42.170 --> 11:43.030
<i>Hey...</i>

11:46.260 --> 11:48.190
<b>I want to go to that place we promised to.</b>

11:48.490 --> 11:50.930
<i>The place we promised to go before?</i>

11:51.230 --> 11:51.810
<b>Yeah.</b>

11:52.330 --> 11:53.850
<b>Okay, let's go.</b>

11:54.150 --> 11:58.110
<i>Can we meet tomorrow at Kirinkan at four?</i>

11:58.110 --> 11:59.400
<b>Sure.</b>

11:59.770 --> 12:00.870
<i>Thanks.</i>

12:00.870 --> 12:02.350
<b>See you tomorrow.</b>

12:02.350 --> 12:03.070
<b>Yep.</b>

12:10.340 --> 12:12.940
<b>Mom, I'll make dinner today.</b>

12:12.940 --> 12:14.790
<b>Oh, that's unusual.</b>

12:22.010 --> 12:23.680
<b>New camping techniques
From: Sacchan
Subject: For tomorrow
Please come to Kirinkan tomorrow at four.</b>

12:24.110 --> 12:25.470
<b>"Meijinden"?</b>

12:26.070 --> 12:27.450
<b>"Kirinkan"?</b>

12:28.290 --> 12:29.760
<b>For tomorrow?</b>

12:33.040 --> 12:36.940
<b>There's so many things I want to say but can't.</b>

12:38.170 --> 12:39.820
<b>The place we promised to go.</b>

12:40.920 --> 12:41.720
<b>Hina-chan!</b>

12:41.720 --> 12:44.990
<b>I wasn't listening to your monologue.</b>

12:55.330 --> 12:56.580
<b>To: Yukinari
Subject: Hinode-hama today
Cumulonimbus.</b>

13:01.000 --> 13:02.920
<b>What are you being so fidgety about?</b>

13:02.920 --> 13:04.700
<b>Are you expecting a message from your girlfriend?</b>

13:04.700 --> 13:05.720
<b>No way.</b>

13:05.720 --> 13:08.630
<b>Just call her. Don't worry about us.</b>

13:08.630 --> 13:10.850
<b>Not that we won't be listening.</b>

13:11.260 --> 13:14.590
<b>Lights out, unless you want your precious message deleted.</b>

13:13.580 --> 13:14.590
<b>Sir!</b>

13:14.590 --> 13:15.940
<b>I'm turning it off.</b>

13:15.940 --> 13:16.730
<b>Go ahead.</b>

13:19.200 --> 13:20.660
<b>That was close.</b>

13:20.660 --> 13:23.250
<b>He can delete the email,
but he can't delete love.</b>

13:23.250 --> 13:24.410
<b>Gross.</b>

13:28.570 --> 13:29.830
<b>Unread emails</b>

13:29.830 --> 13:34.580
<b>Yanagi
Hinode-hama today
Clear skies all day.
In front of the gelato store.
Blacks: 1 Whites: 2</b>

13:32.240 --> 13:34.580
<b>"Blacks: 1, Whites: 2."</b>

13:36.690 --> 13:38.510
<b>"Clear skies today."</b>

13:38.510 --> 13:40.540
<b>"A futon on Hinode Bridge."</b>

13:42.690 --> 13:44.970
<b>"Cumulonimbus. Strong winds."</b>

13:44.970 --> 13:47.470
<b>Cumulonimbus.
Strong winds. 
High tides.</b>

13:45.680 --> 13:46.920
<b>"High tides."</b>

14:11.650 --> 14:12.990
<b>It couldn't be helped.</b>

14:13.370 --> 14:14.880
<b>Just hear me out as you are.</b>

14:15.720 --> 14:17.530
<b>I want to go to the art room.</b>

14:20.320 --> 14:22.850
<b>I don't know what I'll see this time.</b>

14:23.720 --> 14:27.610
<b>Can you talk about what 
you saw at the art room now?</b>

14:28.190 --> 14:29.240
<b>Well—</b>

14:29.540 --> 14:33.310
<b>We might learn something 
about the fragments if we go there.</b>

14:34.860 --> 14:38.480
<b>Do you really want to know about
 the fragments of the future that badly?</b>

14:38.780 --> 14:42.110
<b>We don't have enough
 information about the fragments.</b>

14:43.330 --> 14:44.440
<b>We don't?</b>

14:44.440 --> 14:46.350
<b>We haven't discussed it enough either.</b>

14:46.990 --> 14:50.030
<b>That's why I want to create the same conditions in the same place.</b>

14:50.980 --> 14:52.230
<b>That's not it!</b>

14:52.230 --> 14:53.740
<b>That's not what it's about!</b>

14:53.740 --> 14:56.830
<b>I saw snow. When we were there.</b>

14:57.410 --> 14:59.300
<b>It was a world of silver.</b>

14:59.300 --> 15:00.710
<b>Snow everywhere.</b>

15:01.120 --> 15:02.570
<b>I'd never seen anything like that.</b>

15:03.760 --> 15:05.380
<b>I'm not going.</b>

15:06.470 --> 15:07.480
<b>I see.</b>

15:07.890 --> 15:09.850
<b>That's what you saw.</b>

15:12.750 --> 15:15.640
<b>I haven't been able to 
hear the fragments lately.</b>

15:17.260 --> 15:19.100
<b>I may never hear them again.</b>

15:43.710 --> 15:46.720
<b>Apparently Taniguchi broke
39 minutes in the 10,000 meters.</b>

15:46.720 --> 15:49.980
<b>Seriously? He just started.</b>

15:56.430 --> 15:57.930
<b>From: Yanagi
Subject: Hinode-hama today
Clear skies today.
The Sea of Japan is 
breezy during the summer.</b>

15:58.580 --> 16:00.330
<b>"Clear skies," huh?</b>

16:13.580 --> 16:14.280
<b>Hello?</b>

16:14.840 --> 16:15.860
<i>It's me.</i>

16:15.860 --> 16:17.840
<i>Thanks for the messages.</i>

16:17.840 --> 16:19.640
<b>Sorry they're so weird.</b>

16:20.060 --> 16:21.130
<b>They made me happy.</b>

16:22.200 --> 16:23.160
<b>The waves are</b>

16:23.970 --> 16:26.290
<b>blinding right now.</b>

16:26.850 --> 16:28.920
<b>It's raining over here today.</b>

16:28.920 --> 16:30.070
<b>Oh yeah?</b>

16:31.190 --> 16:32.190
<b>My knees...</b>

16:32.970 --> 16:34.760
<b>They hurt a little.</b>

16:35.600 --> 16:37.380
<i>I told Coach too.</i>

16:37.810 --> 16:39.080
<i>It's nothing.</i>

16:40.870 --> 16:43.730
<i>I might have rushed it too much.</i>

16:44.870 --> 16:48.320
<b>Lots of things happened this summer, huh?</b>

16:49.270 --> 16:51.750
<i>Summer is always like that.</i>

16:52.230 --> 16:54.940
<i>All kinds of things 
happen during the summer.</i>

16:54.940 --> 16:56.460
<i>It's not just this year.</i>

16:56.460 --> 16:57.700
<b>I guess.</b>

16:58.250 --> 17:00.940
<b>Our parents got remarried
 in summer as well, right?</b>

17:01.540 --> 17:04.420
<i>They wanted only a modest wedding, 
since they'd both been married before.</i>

17:04.420 --> 17:05.840
<b>Yeah, right, huh?</b>

17:05.840 --> 17:08.290
<i>Mom changed her wedding outfit three times.</i>

17:09.600 --> 17:10.570
<b>Yeah...</b>

17:12.840 --> 17:15.380
<b>Yeah, I feel relaxed when I talk to you.</b>

17:17.790 --> 17:19.710
<b>Oh. When are you coming home?</b>

17:19.710 --> 17:22.910
<i>Umm, when does camp end again?</i>

17:23.630 --> 17:25.160
<i>I don't know exactly.</i>

17:25.160 --> 17:28.580
<i>We might be done tomorrow, I think.</i>

17:29.370 --> 17:30.440
<b>Same old you.</b>

17:31.830 --> 17:32.690
<i>I'll be waiting.</i>

17:32.690 --> 17:35.320
<b>Yeah, see you at Hinode-hama.</b>

18:08.100 --> 18:09.150
<b>Hiro-kun!</b>

18:10.180 --> 18:11.570
<b>Did you get invited, too?</b>

18:11.570 --> 18:13.340
<b>You too? By Sacchan?</b>

18:13.340 --> 18:14.780
<b>Yep. Let's go.</b>

18:26.550 --> 18:27.410
<b>Sacchan.</b>

18:27.740 --> 18:29.250
<b>Thanks for coming.</b>

18:29.250 --> 18:30.820
<b>Are you doing okay?</b>

18:30.820 --> 18:31.920
<b>I'm fine.</b>

18:31.920 --> 18:32.710
<b>I see.</b>

18:33.290 --> 18:34.670
<b>Thanks, Hiro-kun.</b>

18:35.180 --> 18:38.010
<b>Can I expect an explanation?</b>

18:38.450 --> 18:39.180
<b>Yes.</b>

18:40.840 --> 18:44.010
<b>Is this where you wanted to come?</b>

18:44.460 --> 18:45.270
<b>Yeah.</b>

18:48.320 --> 18:51.630
<b>One of your pictures was
put on display here, wasn't it?</b>

18:51.630 --> 18:53.070
<b>A long time ago.</b>

18:53.070 --> 18:56.370
<b>You can see the Hinode-hama
breakwaters from here, too.</b>

18:56.670 --> 18:59.200
<b>And there's a swallow nest on the roof.</b>

18:59.200 --> 19:01.230
<b>Oh yeah?</b>

19:01.860 --> 19:04.060
<b>You're pretty amazing.</b>

19:04.060 --> 19:06.230
<b>Even if you didn't know,</b>

19:06.230 --> 19:09.910
<b>it's still a lot more wonderful that
 you've been living here all this time.</b>

19:10.360 --> 19:12.050
<b>You think so?</b>

19:12.050 --> 19:13.250
<b>Where is it?</b>

19:14.630 --> 19:17.970
<b>I want to be here after closing.</b>

19:20.390 --> 19:21.940
<b>Will you stay here with me?</b>

19:25.290 --> 19:27.640
<b>What you need "for tomorrow"?</b>

19:45.960 --> 19:48.280
<b>I don't know anything.</b>

19:49.760 --> 19:52.850
<b>About this city, or about Yana-chan,</b>

19:53.170 --> 19:54.480
<b>or about Yuki-kun,</b>

19:54.830 --> 19:57.880
<b>or Hiro-kun, or Sacchan.</b>

19:58.510 --> 20:01.590
<b>Just like I don't know what's about to happen next,</b>

20:01.590 --> 20:03.090
<b>I don't know anything.</b>

20:03.640 --> 20:06.660
<b>You know how you can vaguely
 see the shadow of the moon today?</b>

20:07.240 --> 20:08.720
<b>It's called earthshine.</b>

20:09.790 --> 20:13.730
<b>It's like that because the earth
 is reflecting the sun's light.</b>

20:16.940 --> 20:18.910
<b>So we came here</b>

20:18.910 --> 20:21.280
<b>today to see the moon, Sacchan?</b>

20:21.280 --> 20:21.950
<b>Yeah.</b>

20:23.280 --> 20:23.910
<b>The moon?</b>

20:24.530 --> 20:28.070
<b>This time of the year, this Kirinkan—</b>

20:28.960 --> 20:30.220
<b>It becomes a totally different place,</b>

20:30.540 --> 20:33.540
<b>depending on the season and time.</b>

20:34.360 --> 20:37.470
<b>I'm so glad I could come here,</b>

20:37.840 --> 20:39.080
<b>to my special place,</b>

20:39.380 --> 20:42.680
<b>with you two, Touko-chan and Hiro-kun.</b>

20:43.860 --> 20:45.680
<b>This is your promised place.</b>

20:46.080 --> 20:48.300
<b>Your special place, huh?</b>

20:50.890 --> 20:51.680
<b>Oh yeah?</b>

20:52.260 --> 20:55.530
<b>Sacchan, thanks for bringing me here.</b>

20:55.830 --> 20:57.630
<b>I don't get it.</b>

20:57.630 --> 20:59.360
<b>The moon's pretty though, isn't it?</b>

21:00.850 --> 21:01.940
<b>Oh, <i>that</i> I get.</b>

21:02.620 --> 21:05.370
<b>I heard it becomes a confession
 when you say it like that.</b>

21:05.370 --> 21:06.520
<b>A confession?!</b>

21:06.520 --> 21:08.960
<b>I looked it up recently.</b>

21:08.960 --> 21:13.170
<b>When Soseki Natsume was an English teacher,</b>

21:13.490 --> 21:16.710
<b>that's how he taught how to translate "I love you."</b>

21:16.970 --> 21:19.760
<b>Soseki Natsume? You?</b>

21:19.760 --> 21:21.330
<b>So?</b>

21:21.800 --> 21:24.420
<b>No, nothing,</b>

21:24.910 --> 21:26.200
<b>but why?</b>

21:26.200 --> 21:29.840
<b>It's, like, more tasteful that way.</b>

21:29.840 --> 21:32.310
<b>That would really get your feelings across?</b>

21:32.660 --> 21:33.830
<b>Yeah, I bet it would.</b>

21:33.830 --> 21:35.140
<b>As long as there's love.</b>

21:35.830 --> 21:38.980
<b>Natsume-san was a romantic, huh?</b>

21:40.100 --> 21:42.410
<b>The moon's really pretty.</b>

21:44.960 --> 21:47.660
<b>And those are my lines.</b>

23:29.010 --> 23:31.260
<b>I haven't kept it at all.</b>

23:31.260 --> 23:33.600
<b>Do you like Touko-san?</b>

23:33.600 --> 23:36.140
<b>You haven't been protecting Touko-chan.</b>

23:36.140 --> 23:38.520
<b>Touko Fukami, I miss you.</b>

23:36.560 --> 23:38.520
<b>Episode 10
"Jonathan"</b>

23:38.520 --> 23:40.520
<b></b>
